                  "text": "5:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwong’ ubed wi ng’atu m’utimo ayi m’acwia m’ang’ika kadi m’atwaga, en e ginmajudagu ni Yehova, tic mi cing’ jabodho, man eting’e malu ling’. E dhanu ceke gibiloko lembe gibiwacu kumae, Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
